/*
 * 0x80229998..0x8022ACE4: clDNStartDino (Dino Dino Jungle start gate).
 * The start gate model (or the challenge variant) with two fire-breathing
 * dinosaur heads: fire puffs spawn from the DNA_FIRE joints while the
 * player is near the gate, and a small ember emitter (Hinoko) follows them.
 * The TU owns .rodata 0x803D0DB0..0x803DA278 (the gate's animation data
 * tables plus strings, addressed off one hoisted base).
 */

